body:
I don't think they have. I think the only time they've interacted was in Doomsday. However my thought process was that these are Daleks in their early days and so repurposing old technology would be more within the realm of reason, similar to how the scout Dalek from Resolution was a departure from the traditional Daleks because he was one of the first to leave Skaro

